        "1007",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d0b688a8967e49d24c636d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去抓虫子吧！\n稍微去一下菲律宾吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb27dcfd04b4c5cf22020e64543e21e6175e3b3b8d6c2b6fffb84596efff37d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df5188c1f8e516d5e244a05",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为这只蟋蟀跑进了屋子，\n所以给它起了叫『波奇』的名字。\n今天也过得不错啊，波奇…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f7c35d75f4acaffcc58a82ccf63bf3091177c0bfedc750555b3202715c4a08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420172b8c66094904b510445",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼～，里面有穿\n防弹背心代替内衬…这样\n不管是下鱼叉还是下鲭鱼都能放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0925d5a0de22ad219cb3b120a4ba52a2c5c86931d8aaf84457aee0a7ddaa87ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d56ad037908df8d750cbf78b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "阿船占卜时间！\r\n我看看训练员今天的运势……\r\n……什么！？真假……哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e112d5bd059a5435fd276c9592092bf6738cbb9737c0551625b34c42e63fcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e151dc5dd6cbf508ab88a48b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早晨还真认真啊，\r\n每天早上都乖乖来报到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85788e9069559a52058932332826340a59f3a8aa3e881a72c16c6ebe6907628f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70bc9b14d37e71e7fa32f770",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天起你见到人都要用\r\n「训训～☆」来打招呼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "042dd8aaaf520438c2b56f79f8a57733f2b13db4ed235922c26acbbf5cca2649",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39f20c965ba2b36513ef9ae",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小时候我的头发原本是褐色的，\r\n自从某天把糯米粉洒在头上后\r\n就变成现在这样了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9070baac1f378ff222f71a7d11c46acf0cf13843c4f7e862d5f5f1a7a752f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3fb6c66617f1d1f1677271",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……糟糕，我骗米浴\r\n积雨云是巨大棉花糖，\r\n结果她到现在还相信耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f830dbde5da87042e951800475f63dfa16f38f03bd8c8aeb66d7547462c4ed9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3b818819f0f2837988e963",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "给我听清楚了～\r\n记得用口红在窗户上\r\n写下「西瓜」后再睡喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1126ed7d02aa89840dde2036a856c1e5d06d54b6a42cece3421437959d437503",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd6866de2decb95839cce1b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼……呼……！成功了！\r\n看这华丽的金色花瓣！\r\n正是新品种樱花「金船满开」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a3abfb6cfd0fe1cdf51382ae37e92f2e36e70bfb02fb228d40813f78f76407",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1932e4c8c4829fb385dd7b3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？\r\n太平洋的海浪是两人座喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e5708bdd667a55b89ec05a853903d976346abdcd03bd4877b11d4ba3003076",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7881baaa2d9ae3826c16e0f0",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "吶～你有大台的吸尘器吗～？\r\n我想拿去挖番薯说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c92c39eeecb57cf7c70349e26aa85a2bfe2ed4c24bd0b6a15606d60e768645",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc8cb0b54ea878565bab3d1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啾！\r\n讨厌，忍不住打喷嚏了☆\r\n……你有在听吗喂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc0601b6917d9b78170a85cd53b829c55ef18590cb85abdd46441a597b3f352",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90019"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1007/90019"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b4167d5fc0d518682057e2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐DA☆ZE！",
      "source_fingerprint": "833f8c4d8d580a0807dc9c20e80c743b5af936dad2f2d4397a00cccfc3fea4b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
