      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "寂寥气氛中充斥着一片艳红，\r\n这季节就像阿船呢……\r\n你刚刚是不是这么想啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6422f8cc488c22dfb3ebaa147a1e4da722c0cdc6eefe2f54421e87f02dd64b50",
